//! id:        cfg_tool_mcp_binding_accept
//! section:   16_config
//! expect:    accept
//! manifest:  tools.search.driver=mcp; tools.search.server=stdio:local-search
//! spec:      §17.1 ([tools.NAME] binds a declared tool dependency; MCP is one supported tool transport)
